  "summary": "Customers report Prime delivery times slipping from two days to three or four days, particularly for items from the Hillsboro OR facility [#tk_2868365]. Many complain that guaranteed delivery dates are changed after purchase without notification, causing inconvenience for urgent needs like pet food [#tk_2902547] [#tk_2922516]. Tracking information is frequently unreliable, showing packages as out for delivery before reverting to a two-day estimate [#tk_2971894]. Some users note that orders now take over a week, contradicting the two-day promise and making the membership feel like false advertising [#tk_481640] [#tk_2959928]. Overall, the service is described as unreliable and degraded compared to previous years, leading to significant customer frustration [#tk_2890575] [#tk_457683]."
